   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "An individual is having a very rough time at work lately, with their supervisor criticizing tiny mistakes that would ordinarily be perfectly fine. This frustration causes them to start being short and sarcastic with their partner, and too harsh on their children once they get home. This demonstrates which framework of the association between work and family satisfaction?",
